/-!
# A387384

Array read by antidiagonals, where the n-th row lists primes p such that p+x_1, ..., p+x_1+...+x_k are prime, where (x_1, ..., x_k) is the n-th composition corresponding to an admissible prime tuple pattern (see A387383).

The 66 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

